! NAME | STATEMENT | comment.  "*" after a location is the marker
! discussed above.  Blanks inside names are as punched: the NAME
! column prints "MTC1" and "MR 3AD" where the STATEMENT column
! writes "M TC 1" and "MR3AD" for the same two symbols, so blanks
! inside a STRAP name are not significant.
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
!   line  1  215526.40  000002.05 31                  SV,$2,2.0($1)
!                                        -**LINK FWA IN TENT**
!   line  2  215527.00  000000.00 81  004066.60 50    L(BU,4),0.0($1),-19
